  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When your group starts in on a foe, they just don’t quit…</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Intimidate 3 ranks</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you and at least one ally openly belittle, chide, insult, mock, or otherwise make fun of a target, you may add a cumulative +1 insight bonus to your Performance (comedy) skill checks for each ally who also has this teamwork feat (maximum +5). If you and your allies continue this abuse unhindered for at least 1 minute, you may force that target to make a Will save (DC 10 + 2 for each participant with this feat; maximum DC 20) or suffer the effects of the confusion spell, as if cast by a spell caster equal to your character level.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/seraph-feats#toc27\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
